1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
游乐园最佳路线规划平台（小程序）
Park Route Planner (Mini Program)

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
实时排队与演出场次，生成当下最优下一步
Live waits and show times, turned into the best next step

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
两种沉浸式引导：任务模式 / 副驾模式
Two immersive modes: Mission / Copilot

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
支持实时改道、进度追踪、截图导入（预约/凭证）
Real-time replanning, progress tracking, screenshot import

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:30,000
核心目标：让你现场只做决策，不做计算
Goal: make decisions on-site, not calculations

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
点击“生成路线”，系统给出下一站
Tap “Generate plan” to get your next stop

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:43,000
任务卡展示：步行 ETA、等待分钟、推荐理由
Action card shows walk ETA, wait time, and reasons

8
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:55,000
这不是列表，而是可执行的“下一步动作”
Not a list, but an actionable next step

9
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
当前为副驾模式：更自由、更少打扰
Copilot mode: freer, less interruption

10
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:07,000
模拟排队暴涨：出现提示条（banner）
Simulate a wait spike: a banner appears

11
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:14,000
提示“有更优路线”，点击查看备选
Tap to see better alternatives

12
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:20,000
备选包含步行/等待/省时解释
Alternatives explain walk, wait, and time saved

13
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:26,000
切换到任务模式：更省心、更确定
Switch to Mission mode: more guided and certain

14
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:33,000
关键变化只在地图页弹窗提示
Critical changes show as a modal on the map page only

15
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:40,000
弹窗给出两种选择：暂不调整 / 一键改道
Two choices: keep / one-tap replan

16
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:45,000
推荐项显示节省时长与风险提示
Recommendation shows saved time and risk flags

17
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:52,000
点击“一键改道”，下一站自动更新
Tap “One-tap replan” to update your next stop

18
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:05,000
局部重规划：尽量保持路线稳定
Local replanning keeps your plan stable

19
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:10,000
进度追踪：我到了
Progress: Arrived

20
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:15,000
进度追踪：开始排队
Progress: Queue started

21
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:25,000
进度追踪：已完成（用于战报/成就）
Progress: Done (for recap and achievements)

22
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:32,000
导入截图：从官方 App 截图提取预约信息
Import screenshots to extract reservations

23
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:40,000
解析结果包含日期、入园时间窗、状态等
Parsed fields include date, time window, and status

24
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:50,000
合规路径：用户主动上传，不采集账号密码
Compliant flow: user-provided, no password scraping

25
00:02:50,000 --> 00:03:00,000
任务模式与副驾模式随时切换：只做决定，不做计算
Switch anytime: decide on-site, no calculations

